 "about": {
  "text": "Ruakākā Solar Farm is Meridian Energy's first solar farm in New Zealand, south of Whangārei. It sits beside Meridian's 100 MW Ruakākā battery, and together they make up the Ruakākā Energy Park. About 250,000 panels on 201 hectares across three sites are expected to produce up to 230 GWh a year. Construction began in 2025, with first generation expected in late 2026 and full generation in early 2027.",
